{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]I'd rather have [C7]Jesus than [F]silver or [C]gold;
[C]I'd rather be His than have rich[G7]es [C]un[G]to[G7]ld;
[C]I'd rather have [C7]Jesus than [F]houses or [C]land;
[C]I'd rather be [C7]led [F]by His [C]nail[G7]pierced [C]hand.
[C]Than to [G7]be [C]the [G7]king of a [Am]vast [F]do[C]main or be [G7]held [C]in [G7]sin's dread [F]sw[C]ay!
[C]I'd rather have [C7]Jesus than [F]any[C]thing this world af[G7]fords to[F]da[C]y.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[C]Than to be the [C7]king of a vast [F]domain or be held [C]in sin's dread sway!
[C]I'd rather [G7]have Jesus [C]than anything [G]this world [G7]affords today.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]I'd [C7]rather have [F]Jesus than [C]men's applause;
[C]I'd [G7]rather be [C]faithful [G]to His [G7]dear cause;
[C]I'd [C7]rather have [F]Jesus than [C]world-wide fame;
[C]I'd [C7]rather [F]be true [C]to [G7]His [C]holy name:
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]He's [C7]fairer than [F]lilies of [C]rarest bloom;
[C]He's [G7]sweeter than [C]honey [G]from out [G7]the comb;
[C]He's all [C7]that my [F]hungering spirit [C]needs -
[C]I'd [C7]rather [F]have Jesus [C]and [G7]let [C]Him lead:
{end_of_verse}
